      {
        "id": "DravenSpinning",
        "name": "Spinning Axe",
        "description": "Draven's next attack will deal bonus physical damage. This axe will ricochet off the target high up into the air. If Draven catches it, he automatically readies another Spinning Axe. Draven can have two Spinning Axes at once.",
        "tooltip": "Draven readies a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spinning Axe</span>, causing his next Attack to deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(40/45/50/55/60 + (75/85/95/105/115% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and ricochet into the air. If Draven catches it, he readies another <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spinning Axe</span>.<br /><br />Draven can hold two <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spinning Axes</span> at once.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Draven will drop any <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spinning Axes</span> if he does not attack for 6 seconds. Attacking a turret or structure will not cause Draven's <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spinning Axes</span> to richochet.</span>",
